^{:go/end 2320} (go/func gcTestIsReachable "gcTestIsReachable performs a GC and returns a bit set where bit i\nis set if ptrs[i] is reachable.\n" [& ^{:tag (slice unsafe/Pointer)} ptrs] :results [^uint64 mask]
